                comment: "The richest late Dickens, full of stuff and connections (I've read it six times and each time I go through it again I notice something new I didn't notice before): both a portrait of the Victorian world and a complex tapestry of theme and symbol. I was sorely tempted to list 10 Dickens novels for this exercise, but have restrained myself.",
